  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       AT END  MOVE  HIGH-VALUE TO REC-IN-1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       GO TO ENDING-ROUTINES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO CTR.
