  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD  TAPE-1-CT  TO  INPUT-CT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE    TAPEIN1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE  '   TOTAL RECORDS READ   '  TO  DISP-MESSAGE.
